===Etymology=== 
{{etyl|LL.|en}} ''bronchus,'' from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|βρόγχος |lang=grc}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|en}} {{m|ine-pro|*gʷro-nkh₃-}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*gʷerh₃-||to devour}}
===Noun===
{{en-noun|bronchi}}

# Either of two [[airway]]s, which are primary branches of the [[trachea]], leading directly into the [[lung]]s.
